    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KAZ</strong> is the <strong>ultimate</strong> test of <strong>speed</strong>, <strong>precision</strong>, and raw <strong>skill</strong>. Dive into an electrifying <strong>roguelike</strong> built entirely around <strong>lightning-fast</strong> finger dexterity. Dash and react at blistering pace as you race to dominate the <strong>leaderboards</strong>. Every session delivers fresh challenges, new gear to <strong>unlock</strong>, and endless chances to showcase your <strong>mastery</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/5654d24bc08bfb49a5990394a6a29895.poster.avif?t=1755537913\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/5654d24bc08bfb49a5990394a6a29895.webm?t=1755537913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dash faster, live longer.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frame-Accurate Controls</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The engine accepts more than 20 inputs per second\u2014can you keep up?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Fun, No Filler</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No clumsy story, no boring dialogue, and no f****** tutorial. <strong>Boot, play, grind.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of items, challenges, music, and full-game visual skins.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break the Game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge the perfect build and rewrite the rules</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online &amp; Friends Leaderboards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily, weekly, and monthly ladders\u2014prove your worth and shine in the top three.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced statistics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inputs per second, reaction time, and more. Track performance, sharpen reflexes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Dexterity Trainer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, brutally hard to master. Think fast, act faster\u2014an endless skill ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immediate - Minimalist - Intense - Addictive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through a tight arena using <strong>only four keys</strong>, crushing enemies to rack up points before a ruthless <strong>20-second</strong> fuse burns out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive wave after wave</strong>, strategically unlocking <strong>powerful items</strong> and <strong>game-breaking</strong> upgrades. Customize each run with unique themes, turning every victory into a stylish flex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KAZ is built for <strong>competition</strong>\u2014push your abilities to the limit and climb the ranks where only the sharpest reflexes reign supreme.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your aesthetic </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>hand-crafted themes</strong>, swap the entire look on the fly, and immerse yourself in guest-<strong>artist's universes</strong>\u2014more than 30 themes to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/18b5e67d0c0602d76ac405480b7e9a1a.poster.avif?t=1755537913\" width=720 height=351 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/18b5e67d0c0602d76ac405480b7e9a1a.webm?t=1755537913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you have what it takes to master the frenzy and become the <strong>ultimate KAZ champion</strong>? Prepare your fingers\u2014it's time to prove it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
