    "short_description": "KAZ, your shot of dopamine wrapped in a minimalist roguelike. Execute lightning-fast moves with frame-perfect controls : easy to learn, hard to master. Immediate, Intense, Addictive. Unlocking tons of unique items, skins and challenges. 4 keys, no excuses: Prove your skill and dominate the ranks.",
